WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.240
I've never been to a place like this!

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:07.860
I like it!

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.620
Right, Yozakura-chin?

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.120
That's right.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.400
Kagura-san,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.400
where is the door to the other world?

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.580
Sorry.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.400
I don't know where it is, exactly.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.230
But you know,

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.430
it's going to open soon.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.170
I'm sure of that.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:29.920
I see.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.490
We can't go home and wait
for them to show up.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:36.170
We'll wait here for them to appear.

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:38.530
The others will be here soon.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.690
I don't mind waiting,

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:43.610
but where do we wait?

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.560
It's so chilly outside.
We'll catch a cold.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.930
Don't worry.

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:49.450
I've got a place.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:50.760
Really?

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:51.950
Yay!

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:00.740
Here.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.460
<b>Yamabiko-so</b>

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.270
Sure looks like a traditional inn to me!

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:07.270
It's so classy!

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.510
Fubuki-san...

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:37.990
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:38.740
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:39.450
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:39.780
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:41.950
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:41.950
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:54.550
You're staying here, too?

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:56.090
What a coincidence.

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:58.970
It's not a coincidence!

00:02:58.970 --> 00:02:59.980
Wait.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.840
Fubuki-san,

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:07.000
do you know where the door
to the other world will open?

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:08.590
No.

00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:11.420
I don't know either.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:16.830
So we're in the same situation.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.530
Yumi-chin,

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.440
this is serious!

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:22.610
That's right!

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:25.850
She says she's going
to destroy the shinobi!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:29.010
Let's defeat her before
the youma appear.

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:32.730
I understand what you're saying.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:36.850
But I want to talk to her.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:42.990
It's because I am a child born
of a youma and a human!

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:49.460
Wait!

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:51.120
Tell me more!

00:03:54.570 --> 00:04:00.140
You should know all you need
to know about my rage from that.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.380
I will never forgive the shinobi.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:07.800
I'm sorry,

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:10.900
but I have nothing more to say.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:12.890
Fubuki-san...

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:16.460
The next door to the other world will
be bigger than any before.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:21.900
This will be the last time
that we fight with you shinobi.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:24.910
The final battle, huh?

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.650
That's right.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:30.160
Welcome.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.250
Oh?

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.500
Do you know her?

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.300
No way in heck!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.900
Make sure our room is <i>far</i> away from hers!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.670
Okay...

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.640
What do you mean,
you want to talk to her?

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.300
Well...

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.270
Yumi...

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.650
Please try to understand.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:04.000
I feel like we're going to regret it

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.160
if we fight Fubuki-san like this.

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:08.700
Okay, that's fine.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.800
If you insist.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:11.910
Minori-san...

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.290
But in exchange...

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:14.910
Yes?

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:19.380
We're going to play until
the youma show up!

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.110
Yeah!

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.920
Since we're at a hot spring!

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.120
Oh, fine.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.690
You can do it, Miyabi!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.060
Homura, beat her!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.310
Wait!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.810
Wow!

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:43.780
Oh, no!

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.740
That's not fair, Miyabi!

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.030
Fool!

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.880
It's your fault for looking away.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.490
You're all here too, huh?

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:53.810
Yeah.

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:55.780
Asuka and her group are in the hotel.

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:58.510
Now, Homura, strip.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:00.500
Why strip?

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:05.260
The rules are that the winner
strips off the loser's clothing.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.460
It's strip Ping-Pong!

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.010
Seriously?

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.520
Homura...

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:13.010
You're only wearing panties
under your yukata, right?

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.880
What's your point?!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:20.500
What?

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:21.520
A cloth bra?

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.020
This battle's just beginning!

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:26.520
Very well!

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.090
Crimson Homura in a Ping-Pong game?

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.090
That's not fair!

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:36.970
What's this?

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:39.870
Katsuragi-san, you're too close to the TV.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:47.420
<i>Is this the price of using Fuma Korin?</i>

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.680
What's wrong, Asuka?

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.180
Um, this is...

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:57.220
Sister Katsu isn't fondling my breasts,

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.620
so I thought I'd fondle them myself.

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:02.190
So don't worry about me.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:10.030
This inn has a lot of baths, I heard.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.200
That's really fun!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:15.200
<b>Open-air Baths

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:15.200
<b>Pot Bath</b>

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:18.250
I'll take the open-air bath.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.660
Me, too.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:23.210
Not many people can
fit in the pot bath, I bet.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.950
You use it, then, Yumi.

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:29.710
You have a lot you want
to think about alone, right?

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:31.840
Yozakura-san...

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:37.370
Okay, Yumi-chan!

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:39.410
Come see us later!

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.230
Fubuki-san...

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:56.350
Someone else seems to be here.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.970
You guys are just getting here?

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.810
It feels great.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:05.250
Kagura-san, Naraku-san...

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.060
That's...

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:31.400
Oh, this?

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:37.050
This is something 
Grandfather Kurokage gave me.

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:58.180
I see.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.700
Yeah, that's it, huh?

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.520
No, nothing.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.230
See you in the bath.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:04.930
Okay!

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:07.440
Wait!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:17.450
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:17.450
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:24.210
Looks like there's only one pot bath.

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:26.970
So it seems.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:31.160
Then we'll have to get in together.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:35.010
If we stand outside, we'll get cold.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.090
Yes.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.650
This is a nice bath, huh?

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:50.890
Yes.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:53.690
It warms you up, huh?

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:54.930
Yes.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:58.110
The sky's so pretty, huh?

00:09:58.540 --> 00:09:59.400
Yes.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:26.930
This happened a long
time ago, didn't it?

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.520
Yes.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:33.440
You forget what happens
when you're little, don't you?

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:46.210
My father was a shinobi,

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:47.700
and my mother a youma.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:52.240
They were my parents.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.840
I think you learned this from Rasetsu,

00:10:55.840 --> 00:11:00.450
but some youma have feelings,
like humans do.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:01.490
Yes.

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.890
With feelings comes love.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:08.900
Isn't that normal?

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:12.770
Yes.

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:17.100
I was born because
they loved each other.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:22.140
But that was not to be.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:26.990
My mother was said
to be the ultimate youma.

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:31.670
The shinobi gave up on defeating her.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:34.020
And finally,

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:37.180
with that Fuma Korin, they...

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:45.540
If they use it to seal you away,

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:49.480
you can never return to this world.

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:54.300
Then you'll never
see your mother again?

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:58.000
I lost my mother,

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:02.250
but Grandfather Kurokage took me in.

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:04.660
It wasn't for long,

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:08.110
but when you and I lived together,
 we were like sisters.

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:10.800
But even so,

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:13.300
as long as you're a shinobi,

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.710
you and I will never be friends.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:17.710
Fubuki-san...

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:21.830
The shinobi slaughter the youma.

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:24.770
They tore my mother away from me.

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:34.740
Do we have no choice but to fight?

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.520
Prepare yourself for it.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:42.430
Either the youma or shinobi will die.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.890
It's the only way.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:49.090
That's a shinobi's job.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.870
Those were your words.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.750
Yumi-chan...

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.720
Looks like it's dinnertime.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.420
What's wrong?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.600
Fubuki-san told me everything.

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.310
I see.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.520
So, Asuka-san,

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.080
that's why you tried
to seal the youma, isn't it?

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:26.760
Yes.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:30.900
I decided it was wrong to kill them.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:35.030
But that's against our orders.

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:40.050
Maybe I'll be expelled.

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:43.680
That's why you acted alone...

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.560
To keep everyone else
from being involved.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.700
Can I tell the others?

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:55.610
Yeah.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.930
There's no point in hiding it now.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.120
All right.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:23.470
Are they coming?

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:24.350
Yes.

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:26.160
They'll be here.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:28.420
Now that they know who I am,

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:30.600
they'll have to.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:35.600
See?

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.910
Naraku,

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:39.660
this'll be a long fight,

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.610
but don't get involved.

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:42.960
I know.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:47.610
I don't think you're going to lose.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:49.670
Thanks.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.120
But it's about fifty-fifty.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:00.620
I'm amazed you came
when you know I'll kill you.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:05.130
I know why things felt so weird
when we fought at the shrine.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:06.740
Fubuki-chan,

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:08.630
you're half-youma, right?

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:09.570
Yes,

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.000
that's right.

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:17.640
This is the proof!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:23.320
I'll destroy all youma!

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.150
I see.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.400
So that's how it is.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.620
But what of it?

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.080
No matter the reason,

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:40.100
they've still done harm to humanity.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:44.410
You can always come up with
justifications about who struck first.

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:48.290
I have sympathy for Fubuki,

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.420
but we're not that 
different ourselves, are we?

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:55.420
You girls in Gessen
all lost your parents, too.

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.000
That's true.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:01.930
But I want to seal
the youma, not kill them.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:03.620
I refuse.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:06.560
A shinobi's job is to slay youma.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.940
I'm not straying from that.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.600
There's no more sense
in discussing this more.

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:17.140
Her mother was killed by a youma.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.030
It's the natural response, I guess.

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:21.600
Yes.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:27.410
It goes against our mission
not to kill them anyway, right?

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:29.970
Not that we rogue shinobi care.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:32.210
But you shinobi students...

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.720
Asuka?

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:41.460
Even if I'm punished, I'll still do it.

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:42.980
I've already come this far.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:57.130
We heard what you said.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.310
You're so silly.

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.120
You should've told us.

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:03.550
We'll all do this together!

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:05.120
Like we always have!

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:07.800
If we get expelled
from Hanzo Academy,

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:09.630
we'll work something out.

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.710
We can be rogue shinobi,

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.630
like Homura's group!

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:16.200
We can call ourselves...

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.640
Asuka's Royal Guards!

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:20.640
Aw...

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.020
I like it!

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:23.150
Guys!

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.600
Asuka-chan!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.680
<i>I have to do my best.</i>

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:39.520
<i>This'll be the last chance
I get to fight alongside them.</i>

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:47.970
<i>Fubuki's mother was said
to be the strongest youma.</i>

00:17:47.970 --> 00:17:52.800
<i>Which shinobi could have sealed her?</i>

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:03.040
Kagura-san...

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:06.020
Sorry for coming so late.

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:09.130
Can we talk?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.430
Kagura-san?

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:49.330
<i>I didn't think they'd actually
 be on the same level.</i>

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:56.230
<i>Win, Fubuki, for the sake of our great desire.</i>

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:00.990
What's wrong?

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.240
You're out of breath.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:07.570
Worry about yourself, not me.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:12.700
<i>Now, what to do?</i>

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.120
Kagura!

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:35.820
Stay away!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.020
I told you to stay out of this!

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.360
It's time to end this, isn't it?

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:43.810
Yeah, you're right.

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:57.170
Susanowo!

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:14.060
Kagura-san!

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.140
<i>Yumi!</i>

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:18.440
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:23.420
<i>I see...</i>

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:26.110
<i>So I won't be the one to finish this?</i>

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:28.410
<i>So that's my fate?</i>

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:42.250
Kagura!

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:43.330
Kagura-san!

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.420
Kagura, are you okay?

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:48.040
Wake up!

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:54.020
I won't kill you.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:59.190
Just watch as the youma
destroy the shinobi.

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:07.820
Kagura, why?

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:10.950
You had several chances to win.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.880
I guess I screwed up.

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:20.970
So, Yumi-chan...

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.970
You stop her.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:27.470
Can I do that?

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:28.890
You sure can.

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:32.480
No, only you can do it.

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:36.630
Think about why she still had

